            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/mh156nr8259#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Stamped in black, six figures without separators, set across the roll at roughly 55 degrees rather than along it; read after rotating. Figures 2 and 4 are filled with ink but keep their oval outline, which is why the reading is not called high; 1, 3, 5 and 6 are plain."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    }
